</table></div><h1>5、通用相关接口</h1><div style="margin-left:0px;"><h2>5.1、1. 根据机器ID获取货架库存信息列表</h2><div style="margin-left:0px;"><h5>简要描述</h5>
<ul>
<li>根据机器ID获取货架库存信息列表</li>
</ul>
<h5>接口API名称</h5>
<ul>
<li><code>get_inventory_list</code></li>
</ul>
<h5>请求方式</h5>
<ul>
<li>POST </li>
</ul>
<h5>参数</h5>
<table>
<thead><tr style='background-color: rgb(0, 136, 204); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>
<th style="text-align: left;">参数名</th>
<th style="text-align: left;">必选</th>
<th style="text-align: left;">类型</th>
<th>说明</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td style="text-align: left;">machine_id</td>
<td style="text-align: left;">是</td>
<td style="text-align: left;">string</td>
<td>机器编号</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="text-align: left;">product_id</td>
<td style="text-align: left;">否</td>
<td style="text-align: left;">string</td>
<td>商品id(选填)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="text-align: left;">shelf_on</td>
<td style="text-align: left;">是</td>
<td style="text-align: left;">int</td>
<td>是否上架 1(目前机器上已上架，不包含备用库存)； 0(目前机器上已上架 + 以前在本机器上上架过的), 默认0</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="text-align: left;">pageNum</td>
<td style="text-align: left;">是</td>
<td style="text-align: left;">int</td>
<td>页面数据条数</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="text-align: left;">page</td>
<td style="text-align: left;">否</td>
<td style="text-align: left;">int</td>
<td>页码，默认1</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<h5>返回示例</h5>
<table width='100%' class='codestyle'><pre><code>{
    &quot;status_code&quot;: 0,
    &quot;msg&quot;: &quot;成功&quot;,
    &quot;data&quot;: {
        &quot;total&quot;: 30,
        &quot;per_page&quot;: 15,
        &quot;current_page&quot;: 1,
        &quot;last_page&quot;: 2,
        &quot;data&quot;: [
            {
                &quot;mc_id&quot;: 43208,
                &quot;channel_code&quot;: &quot;E04&quot;,
                &quot;quantity&quot;: 0,
                &quot;sale_price&quot;: &quot;0.01&quot;,
                &quot;g_retail_price&quot;: &quot;29.9&quot;,
                &quot;sku&quot;: &quot;000KB-KB30006-01&quot;,
                &quot;mismatch_quantity&quot;: 10,
                &quot;product_id&quot;: 120,
                &quot;g_name&quot;: &quot;丝丝的游戏派对宝盒&quot;,
                &quot;market_price&quot;: &quot;23.00&quot;,
                &quot;reserver_quantity&quot;: 0,
                &quot;slot_max_count&quot;: 10,
                &quot;pic&quot;: &quot;https://api.kiosk-uat.kalos-blocks.com/uploads/excel_img/20240719/5218e42a760d61826ac125c9c5fef7d8.jpeg&quot;,
                &quot;details_pic&quot;: &quot;&quot;,
                &quot;banner&quot;: &quot;&quot;,
                &quot;sku2&quot;: &quot;&quot;,
                &quot;g_desc&quot;: &quot;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\&quot;https://api.kiosk-uat.kalos-blocks.com/uploads/goods/20240719/1da9e49a9361c7a13d6d3df53882fc82.jpg\&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&quot;
            },
            {
                &quot;mc_id&quot;: 43194,
                &quot;channel_code&quot;: &quot;C03&quot;,
                &quot;quantity&quot;: 7,
